      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is likely highly specific to your interface, so it would be good to share the following info:\n- What interface are you using?\n- How are the inputs hooked up?\n- Describe your interface.\n- Do you have another Stereo Input source that does work properly? Or is this consistent with all Stereo Input sources.\n- If you try and use this setup in Skype or Discord as you are trying in VRChat, does the same behavior occur?\nAlso, note that VRChat voice is Mono. So if you can mix down the channels in another manner before they get to VRChat, you will have a workaround.",
